From 4c551545de3bc1a5d90bed85a2f26216b663f91e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 08:10:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Extract travel entities before asking for clarification.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Stop the generic “tell me a little more” reply when the user already
supplied origin, destination, dates, times, hotel area, and car hire.
Persist those requirements in conversation state and ask only for the
smallest missing detail (for example which Friday at end of August).
